  "review": {
    "images": "Eight native project renders from the DAMAC Bay 2 presentation and digital brochure. The waterfront image shows Bay 2 at left and the older DAMAC Bay towers at right, with the projects distinguished in the caption.",
    "location": "DAMAC’s own marker and the branded page 7 site diagram identify Dubai Harbour. The developer’s main panel and FAQ disagree on Dubai Marina Mall, Ibn Battuta and DXB times. The displayed estimates omit those routes.",
    "floorPlans": "All 60 original plan spreads on physical pages 42–55 and 57–102 of the 104-page DAMAC digital brochure. The shorter FP Property-hosted copy omits some later plans. Bayut’s tower label for the 5 BR Type B differs from the brochure’s Tower B levels 54–55. The page retains the original drawing. No unit totals are printed in the brochure and the early presentation area table is a type range for different launch stock."
  },
